  "backlog-why": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 160,
   "page": "backlog",
   "size": 24,
   "text": "6 Oct: Yeshu chose 2.1A (side by side) and 3.1A (timer round the edge). These two B options are kept here for reference.",
   "w": 900,
   "x": 0,
   "y": 560
  },
  "decide-figures": {
   "fill": "orange",
   "maxH": 520,
   "page": "approved",
   "size": 24,
   "text": "Form figures: built for the watch in build 7.\n\nm · Every exercise in your plan has a figure, and every one turns: board 13.3 shows all 50, moving. The other 200 in the database wait for the iPhone and onboarding work.",
   "w": 520,
   "x": 1360,
   "y": 1160
  },
  "decide-notes": {
   "fill": "orange",
   "maxH": 760,
   "page": "live-watch",
   "size": 24,
   "text": "Approved by Yeshu on 6 Oct and built as build 7. To confirm on your watch: effort shows on the workout in Fitness, and the controls icons no longer start small.\n\n\nn · Ramp-up sets: two lighter sets before the first main lift (50% × 8, 75% × 4), one before other main lifts. Not counted, tapped off. Working sets and \"Last\" stay as they are.\no · Effort: the watch asks 1 to 10 after Finish and saves it with the workout, so Fitness shows it. Needs one more Health permission.\np · Skip in the controls jumps to the next exercise and leaves this one open; the workout comes back to it. Dropping one for the day is the swipe in Today.\nq · Figures store depth, so they can be turned with the Crown on the watch. Every exercise in the plan gets one.",
   "w": 620,
   "x": 3968,
   "y": 8716
  },
  "decide-onboarding": {
   "fill": "orange",
   "maxH": 700,
   "page": "review",
   "size": 24,
   "text": "Onboarding and the plan: yes or no to each?\n\ni · The plan is built by fixed rules on the phone: no account, no server, no AI call. Rules and six test plans are in design/plan-builder.\nj · Nine questions. Weight, height and sex are not asked.\nk · Your own v11 plan stays. Onboarding is for a new install and for \"Rebuild my plan\" in Settings.\nl · Swapping in exercises from the database replaces the spec line \"never suggest exercises that are not in the plan\".\n\nBoards 12.1 to 12.4 show the plan the rules build for your answers.",
   "w": 560,
   "x": 6240,
   "y": 8415
  },
  "decide-phone": {
   "fill": "orange",
   "maxH": 520,
   "page": "review",
   "size": 24,
   "text": "iPhone: what changes besides the look. Yes or no to each?\n\ng · Today's card counts what goes up and what goes lighter today.\nh · Rows lose the kind icons and the chevrons. Target weight and its tag sit on the right.",
   "w": 520,
   "x": 4160,
   "y": 0
  },
  "decide-watch": {
   "fill": "orange",
   "maxH": 780,
   "page": "live-watch",
   "size": 24,
   "text": "Approved by Yeshu on 6 Oct and built as build 7. Set screen 2.1A, rest screen 3.1A.\n\nWhat changes besides the look:\n\na · The set screen shows last time's reps for this set (\"Last 9\").\nb · Undo moves from the set screen to the rest and break screens.\nc · Today rows lose the round kind icons. The target weight sits on the right, with an arrow when it goes up or down today.\nd · A rest day has no Start workout button.\ne · End workout is one screen with three buttons, no scrolling.\nf · \"Back to list\" under All done is gone (Back is already there).",
   "w": 620,
   "x": 1360,
   "y": 0
  },
