   "x": 0,
   "y": -1630
  },
  "decide-7oct": {
   "fill": "orange",
   "maxH": 700,
   "page": "review",
   "size": 24,
   "w": 560,
   "x": 2600,
   "y": -1300,
   "text": "From your 7 Oct session. Yes or no to each?\n\nr · After Finish with items left, Today shows Finished with what is left. Start again picks them up in the same session; Health gets a second workout; effort is asked again.\ns · The plan slot becomes Machine Chest Press alone. Everything logged under \"(or Flat Bench)\" counts as Machine Chest Press. Say if most of it was on the bench.\nt · A swap on the watch is for today only. Changing the plan for good comes with the iPhone round.\nu · The swap list is the database's alternatives for the exercise, the same list onboarding uses.\n\nThe rest timer's corners are a build fix, waiting on a photo of your watch."
  },
  "row7octb": {
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 4000,
   "page": "review",
   "text": "Revised 7 Oct · rest and break without the reason line (3.1A–3.14, 5.5) · back to Live · Watch when built",
   "w": 240,
   "x": 0,
   "y": -3130
  },
  "decide-7octb": {
   "fill": "orange",
   "maxH": 600,
   "page": "review",
   "size": 24,
   "w": 560,
   "x": 4160,
   "y": -2800,
   "text": "Your nine notes of 7 Oct. Yes or no to each?\n\nv · The break screen also loses its result line, and All done its last-exercise line. The arrow still says up or down.\nw · Ten body points: weight, neck, shoulders, chest, arm, forearm, waist, hips, thigh, calf. Fewer if you want.\nx · Swap from the iPhone is for today only, like the watch. The Plan editor changes it for good.\n\nThe 12 redrawn figures are on 13.3 (Approved page) and in 2.11, 2.12, 2.15, 7.7."
  },
  "rowlook": {
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 3000,
   "page": "review",
   "text": "Chosen 7 Oct: look B (Depth). Applied to Today first; History, Plan, Settings follow one by one. The reference board is on Approved.",
   "w": 240,
   "x": 0,
   "y": -4530
  },
  "decide-look": {
   "fill": "orange",
   "maxH": 600,
   "page": "review",
   "size": 24,
   "w": 560,
   "x": 1600,
   "y": -4200,
   "text": "Afternoon of 7 Oct.\n\nLook: B chosen (Yeshu, 7 Oct). The Today screens below in the iPhone row are now in look B; say what to change before History gets the same treatment.\n\ny · No back button on workout screens: yes, done.\nz · Rearrange days: a drag sheet from Plan's more menu (9.6) and from the onboarding preview (12.7). Yes or no?\n\nAlso done from your last message: no 'Rest' title on rest screens; the rest never pauses (3.5 dropped)."
  },
